ted_at":"2026-10-08T06:51:48Z"}],"body":"## Changes\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n- feat(desktop): add native macOS app and signed release integration ([#79](https://github.com/elva-labs/awsesh/pull/79)) by @Paliago\r\n- feat(desktop): add application icon and refresh documentation ([#85](https://github.com/elva-labs/awsesh/pull/85)) by @Paliago\r\n\r\n## Fixes\r\n\r\n- fix(release): align organization signing secrets for v1.1.1 ([#81](https://github.com/elva-labs/awsesh/pull/81)) by @Paliago\r\n- fix(release): wait for npm registry propagation ([#78](https://github.com/elva-labs/awsesh/pull/78)) by @Paliago\r\n- fix(tui): keep list selection when rows re-render ([#84](https://github.com/elva-labs/awsesh/pull/84)) by @TastefulElk, @Paliago\r\n\r\n## Maintenance\r\n\r\n- chore(release): prepare v1.1.3 ([#86](https://github.com/elva-labs/awsesh/pull/86)) by @Paliago\r\n- docs(installation): document desktop Homebrew distribution ([#83](https://github.com/elva-labs/awsesh/pull/83)) by @Paliago\r\n\r\n## Contributors\r\n\r\n@Paliago and @TastefulElk\r\n\r\n[Full changelog](https://github.com/elva-labs/awsesh/compare/v1.0.19...v1.1.3)\r\n\r\n\r\nSource commit: c9e5a0b5e7584ec167ce39fdf5bff0fa80ecafde\r\n","mentions_count":2}
